              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">A Standard Bearer has a horse, hand weapon and heavy armour. May have cataphract armour (+1) and barding (+4). Note the Cataphract rule does not apply to Characters despite the armour option.</characteristic>
